#: ../../explanation/index.md:1
msgid "Explanation"
msgstr "解説"

#: ../../explanation/index.md:3
msgid "Deeper understanding of pyvista-wasm concepts and architecture."
msgstr "pyvista-wasmの概念とアーキテクチャのより深い理解。"

#: ../../explanation/index.md:5
msgid "Overview"
msgstr "概要"

#: ../../explanation/index.md:7
msgid ""
"pyvista-wasm is a PyVista-like API for VTK.wasm, bringing the intuitive "
"PyVista interface to WebAssembly-based 3D visualization. It enables 3D "
"visualization in browser environments including Pyodide, JupyterLite, and"
" Streamlit applications."
msgstr ""
"pyvista-wasmはVTK.wasmのPyVistaライクなAPIであり、直感的なPyVista"
"インターフェースをWebAssemblyベースの3D可視化にもたらします。Pyodide、"
"JupyterLite、Streamlitアプリケーションなどのブラウザ環境での3D可視化を"
"可能にします。"

#: ../../explanation/index.md:11
msgid "Architecture"
msgstr "アーキテクチャ"

#: ../../explanation/index.md:13
msgid "pyvista-wasm separates concerns between Python and JavaScript:"
msgstr "pyvista-wasmはPythonとJavaScriptの責任を分離します:"

#: ../../explanation/index.md:15
msgid ""
"**Python side**: Handles geometry preparation, scene configuration, and "
"API surface."
msgstr ""
"**Python側**: ジオメトリの準備、シーンの設定、およびAPIサーフェスを"
"担当します。"

#: ../../explanation/index.md:16
msgid ""
"**JavaScript side (VTK.wasm)**: Handles the actual geometry parsing and "
"WebGL rendering via WebAssembly."
msgstr ""
"**JavaScript側（VTK.wasm）**: 実際のジオメトリ解析とWebAssembly経由の"
"WebGLレンダリングを担当します。"

#: ../../explanation/index.md:18
msgid "Features"
msgstr "機能"

#: ../../explanation/index.md:20
msgid "PyVista-like API for familiar usage"
msgstr "使い慣れたPyVistaライクなAPI"

#: ../../explanation/index.md:21
msgid "Integration with VTK.wasm for web-based visualization"
msgstr "Webベースの可視化のためのVTK.wasmとの統合"

#: ../../explanation/index.md:22
msgid "Support for JupyterLite, marimo, and stlite"
msgstr "JupyterLite、marimo、stliteのサポート"

#: ../../explanation/index.md:23
msgid "Physically Based Rendering (PBR) with metallic and roughness controls"
msgstr "メタリックとラフネスを制御可能な物理ベースレンダリング（PBR）"

#: ../../explanation/index.md:24
msgid "PLY, OBJ, STL, GLTF, and PolyData file format readers"
msgstr "PLY、OBJ、STL、GLTF、PolyDataファイル形式のリーダー"
